# FACETTED ENUMERATION — a domain's default category must not erase the facet
# explicitly requested by the question.
#
# Chess is only the real stimulus.  The invented game and the runtime
# ablations prove that the answer comes from side_color/2 plus the live frame,
# not from a chess phrase or from a fixed pair in the renderer.

[mock live]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_WORLD_FACTS=1
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the requested facet outranks the domain default]
> quali sono i colori che identificano gli scacchi
< Bianco e nero.
<! Re, regina, torre, alfiere, cavallo e pedone.
> what are the colors that identify chess
< White and black.
<! King, queen, rook, bishop, knight and pawn.
> what are the chess pieces
< King, queen, rook, bishop, knight and pawn.

[test a new domain and its facet grow at runtime]
!assert side_color(zorvian, amber)
!assert side_color(zorvian, violet)
> what are the colors that identify zorvian
< Amber and violet.
!assert side_color(zorvian, silver)
> what are the colors that identify zorvian
< Amber, violet and silver.
!forget side_color(zorvian, violet)
> what are the colors that identify zorvian
< Amber and silver.

[test the surface relation remains live knowledge]
!forget answer_frame("what are the colors", side_color)
> what are the colors that identify zorvian
<! Amber and silver.
!assert answer_frame("what are the colors", side_color)
> what are the colors that identify zorvian
< Amber and silver.

